        "description": "Welcome to Wii Tag!\n\nGet ready to run, chase, and outmaneuver your friends in this action-packed party game that redefines the classic game of tag. But watch out—these arenas are full of surprises, from moving platforms to sudden hazards that can shift the tide of the match in an instant. Stay sharp, stay fast, and stay one step ahead of the competition.\n\nWith colorful arenas, lively animations, and endless customization options, Wii Tag is more than just a game—it's a test of speed, strategy, and split-second decision-making. Customize your character, master power-ups, and rise through the ranks as you prove your skills in solo challenges or chaotic multiplayer mayhem. So grab your controllers, call your friends, and get ready to tag, dodge, and dominate in the world of Wii Tag!",
